  "description": "Fast fuzzy string matching and best-match extraction with rapidfuzz semantics: the Fuzz.Ratio/PartialRatio/token/WRatio scorer family, Levenshtein, Indel, Jaro-Winkler, Hamming and LCS distance kernels, Process.ExtractOne/Extract over any collection, and Process.Dedupe to collapse near-duplicate records. Bit-parallel Myers/Hyyrö kernels with genuine scoreCutoff early exits, an allocation-free Ratio hot path, and scores verified against thousands of vectors generated from rapidfuzz itself. Zero external dependencies.",
